CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract foo
^\[set_g\.assigns\.\d+\] line 5 Check that g is assignable: FAILURE$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
The functions that functions called in contract clauses call are instrumented
as well: requires clauses must not assign to g, not even via calls to helper
functions.
